1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
National Radio and Television Administration

2
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Welcome to Pangjie Bathhouse.

3
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:53,479
Director, we dug it up.

4
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:54,210
Sister Long.

5
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:56,759
Come.

6
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,920
Wait. Get out of the way.

7
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,680
Be careful.

8
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,000
Really?

9
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,520
It's just ordinary soil.

10
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,970
Soil containing mercury doesn't look like this.

11
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,560
Isn't there more underneath?

12
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,400
What if it's one bag of soil and one bag of waste?

13
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,320
Keep digging.

14
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,000
This is all dirt too.

15
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,840
Let's find all twenty spots.

16
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,370
I refuse to believe we can't dig up this waste.

17
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,240
Where did they go? How many of them?

18
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,440
Keep an eye on them.

19
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,360
Come on, get out.

20
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,240
Do you even know how to drive?

21
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,280
What are you yelling about?

22
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,280
Did I hit you?

23
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,920
It'd be too late if you hit me.

24
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,040
You didn't even look at the intersection.

25
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:09,280
You just rushed out.

26
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,560
What do you mean rushed out?

27
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,160
I have a dashcam in my car.

28
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,920
It definitely recorded who hit who.

29
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,200
Fine, let's call the police.

30
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,520
Let the traffic police take a look.

31
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,120
Look, I'll show you.

32
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:22,079
You think you can run amok just because you drive a luxury car?

33
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:23,760
Who do you think you are?

34
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,170
What are you staring at?

35
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,520
How is your leg?

36
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,320
Not too good, boss.

37
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,320
You hit it a bit too hard.

38
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:50,400
The doctor said the nerve is injured.

39
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,480
It needs time to heal.

40
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,680
Don't worry.

41
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,600
You helped me.

42
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,440
I won't treat you badly.

43
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,960
Thank you, boss.

44
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:04,600
If the police come looking for you...

45
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,800
Understood. Xiao Jun did it.

46
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,680
I won't sell you out.

47
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,960
Good. Good boy.

48
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,000
Just the two of us?

49
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,000
When you drink, it's merrier with more people.

50
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,680
I want to talk to you alone.

51
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,680
Alone?

52
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,560
Alright, I know.

53
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,280
I wronged you last time.

54
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,560
They are just workers.

55
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,159
We are brothers. Can't you see the relationship clearly?

56
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,600
I see it very clearly.

57
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,400
You're still so petty.

58
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,840
Dali.

59
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,560
I still remember,

60
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,960
the first time I drank,

61
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,720
it was with you.

62
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,560
Exactly.

63
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,760
We had no money in our pockets back then,

64
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,960
and we were too embarrassed to ask our families for it.

65
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,000
I remember.

66
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,400
Then we went

67
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,720
to help others in a gang fight to show support.

68
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,400
No, at that time we just wanted to go

69
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,600
strike a pose

70
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,800
and earn an appearance fee, right?

71
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,400
Yeah.

72
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,160
Who knew those bastards were playing for real?

73
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,080
They almost beat me to death.

74
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:33,000
How much did they pay us for one fight back then?

75
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,400
Fifty each.

76
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,120
Fifty bucks.

77
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,880
I can still remember.

78
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,560
I clutched that money so hard it got all crumpled.

79
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:42,000
Then we used that money to buy alcohol.

80
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,080
And then I felt,

81
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,920
the first sip had no taste.

82
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,480
I had a wound in my mouth,

83
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,400
and it stung so badly.

84
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,400
And you were so loyal.

85
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,800
You left the last sip of alcohol for me.

86
00:05:57,159 --> 00:05:58,040
Do you know why?

87
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,120
Because it hurt me too.

88
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,480
Back then,

89
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,050
we had nothing, but it was really good.

90
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,120
Exactly.

91
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:19,330
So the day you came back from out of town to find me,

92
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:22,120
I was so happy, really.

93
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,120
I thought,

94
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:25,480
we brothers are still meant to be.

95
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:29,600
From now on, we can work hard and drink together again.

96
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,480
Huzi.

97
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:37,480
In the future, we will be able to afford all kinds of alcohol.

98
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,480
There will be good days ahead, Huzi.

99
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,280
Come on.

100
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,850
Pour the drinks.

101
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,680
Why are you shaking?

102
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,600
Are you drunk?

103
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,360
Dali.

104
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,880
You should turn yourself in.

105
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,360
What?

106
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,720
Well...

107
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,160
About Jun...

108
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,780
I know everything.

109
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,400
You committed intentional injury,

110
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,260
and made your guy commit perjury.

111
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:23,120
Too bad you forgot to delete the dashcam footage.

112
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,480
Wait, they didn't wrong you.

113
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,720
Wait, you...

114
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,700
You really came here undercover?

115
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,120
Dali.

116
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,040
I can't watch you keep making mistakes.

117
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,000
I...

118
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,440
If you turn yourself in and confess,

119
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,480
you can get a reduced sentence.

120
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,159
Turn myself in, my ass!

121
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,600
Dong Beihu, how have I wronged you?

122
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,400
I gave you my car and my card.

123
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:53,480
I let you manage my entire bathhouse.

124
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,159
I gave you my all.

125
00:07:55,159 --> 00:07:57,600
And you're playing undercover with me here?

126
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,720
I'm your brother.

127
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,360
I'm saving you.

128
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,360
Saving me?

129
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,850
Saving me with this?

130
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,560
Isn't this ruining me?

131
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,320
I was like a dog out there.

132
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,480
People looked down on me.

133
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,960
I came back and finally made something of myself.

134
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,620
I'm about to have everything.

135
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,760
Fine, you want me to turn myself in.

136
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,280
You want me to go to jail.

137
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,920
Are you trying to ruin me?

138
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,200
Some brother you are.

139
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,480
Dong Beihu.

140
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,120
From now on,

141
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,720
we go our separate ways.

142
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,360
We have nothing to do with each other.

143
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,160
Get out.

144
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,090
I will hold the sword of justice

145
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:43,520
and seek justice for those who suffer injustice in the world.

146
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,720
Then I will become the best lawyer in the world.

147
00:09:58,680 --> 00:09:59,800
We agreed back then.

148
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,660
In the future, we will join forces

149
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,170
and roam the world with our swords.

150
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:18,880
Don't worry about Jun.

151
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,210
I have the key evidence.

152
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,480
He will definitely be fine.

153
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,880
Just fight with peace of mind.

154
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,410
What happened to your face?

155
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,240
It's nothing. It's raining.

156
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:29,040
The road is slippery, and I fell.

157
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,480
Thank you.

158
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,480
Don't mention it.

159
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,720
Good luck.

160
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,480
It's okay.

161
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,180
Have a seat.

162
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,760
Lawyer Wang is a great man.

163
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,320
Sue Wan Gang.

164
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,120
Sue Wan Gang.

165
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,080
He's a good man. Let's go back and sit down.

166
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,000
Please return to your seat, ma'am.

167
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,880
Keep quiet.

168
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,240
All rise.

169
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:32,000
The presiding judge and judges will now take their seats.

170
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,200
Please be seated.

171
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,240
Appellant,

172
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:45,880
please state your appeal requests and reasons.

173
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,000
Yes, Your Honor.

174
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,320
During the first trial,

175
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,360
we suspected

176
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,720
that the sewage discharge from Wangang Factory

177
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,320
caused the death of the shrimp in the farm.

178
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:57,540
However, through our further investigation, we found

179
00:11:57,600 --> 00:12:00,640
that our initial direction of investigation was wrong.

180
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,240
The real source of pollution

181
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:05,120
comes from Baizhao County, Leyang City,

182
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,720
specifically Fuyuan Village.

183
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:09,840
The mercury content in the village's groundwater seriously exceeds the standard.

184
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,480
Last year's flood control project

185
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:14,640
happened to change the flow of the village's groundwater.

186
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:17,120
Thus, the mercury-contaminated groundwater,

187
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,720
after being washed by heavy rain,

188
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:21,240
flowed along the Baizhao River to the farm,

189
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:24,360
causing huge losses to the farmers.

190
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,000
So,

191
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,240
where did the groundwater pollution in Fuyuan Village

192
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,480
come from?

193
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:32,120
This goes back 28 years.

194
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,240
Back then, Wangang

195
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,240
was still a small chemical factory,

196
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,760
mainly engaged in the production and processing of polyvinyl chloride.

197
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,760
And during this process,

198
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:40,040
a catalyst called

199
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,840
mercuric catalyst was needed.

200
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:44,020
The waste generated by this catalyst

201
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,080
is highly toxic

202
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,680
and requires safe disposal.

203
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:48,840
The factory director at that time,

204
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,360
who is now Wan Jiliang,

205
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,560
lined his own pockets

206
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,000
and embezzled these public funds.

207
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,520
He also sent people to bury the untreated mercury waste

208
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:57,240
near Fuyuan Village.

209
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:58,420
Over the years,

210
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:01,400
this batch of waste slowly seeped into the ground.

211
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,480
Eventually polluting the groundwater of Fuyuan Village.

212
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,440
In 2002,

213
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:07,570
Xue Lin, an employee in Wangang's production workshop,

214
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,240
due to frequent miscarriages,

215
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:11,370
suspected she had mercury poisoning,

216
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,480
so she sued Wangang.

217
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,480
Coincidentally, her lawyer at the time

218
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,240
is the one sitting across from me right now,

219
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,570
Attorney Wang Binghui.

220
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:22,440
Attorney Wang is a great guy.

221
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,360
sued Wan Gang.

222
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,240
Objection.

223
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,480
Your Honor,

224
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,240
Xue Lin's lawsuit has nothing to do with this case.

225
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:33,360
Moreover, in Xue Lin's lawsuit against Wan Gang back then,

226
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,720
she lost the case.

227
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,000
Facts have proven

228
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,240
that there is no causal relationship

229
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:40,000
between her miscarriage and Wan Gang.

230
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,840
That's because Xue Lin made a mistake.

231
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:44,120
She thought she was poisoned in Wangang,

232
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,520
but in reality,

233
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,600
she was poisoned in her hometown,

234
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,200
Fuyuan Village.

235
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,600
At that time, most of the villagers in Fuyuan Village

236
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,080
got their daily water

237
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,640
from a single well.

238
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,080
In other words,

239
00:13:57,960 --> 00:14:00,820
Xue Lin wasn't the only one with mercury poisoning.

240
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:04,220
Other villagers who used the same well were also affected.

241
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,840
Some of them suffer from severe kidney disease

242
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,240
and will need dialysis for the rest of their lives.

243
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,900
Some have swollen knee joints

244
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:13,240
and need crutches to walk.

245
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,740
Some have suffered hearing loss.

246
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,480
Some even got cancer

247
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,600
and passed away early.

248
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,360
Objection.

249
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,360
The symptoms mentioned by the appellant

250
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,000
could be related to family genetics, lifestyle,

251
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,460
and working environment.

252
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,360
These factors could all be relevant.

253
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,600
It's far-fetched to insist

254
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,880
on linking them to mercury poisoning.

255
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:38,600
Last week, we specifically provided

256
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:41,520
free testing for the villagers of Fuyuan Village,

257
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:44,320
and no mercury residue was detected.

258
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,120
It's been over 20 years.

259
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,720
Even if there was mercury residue in their bodies,

260
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,320
it would have been metabolized.

261
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,080
Your Honor.

262
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,240
At the same time,

263
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:54,240
I would like to submit a groundwater test report.

264
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,000
We have also provided a test report.

265
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,240
Sorry to interrupt.

266
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,480
My report

267
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,080
is from 23 years ago,

268
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,880
which was the fifth year after Wangang buried the waste.

269
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:06,210
It was personally requested by you, Attorney Wang Binghui.

270
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,490
Have you forgotten?

271
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,480
Actually, it's not that

272
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,760
no one noticed the abnormality in Fuyuan Village.

273
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:12,620
Director Wang,

274
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,360
also known as Wang Binghui,

275
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:15,480
the defense lawyer for Xue Lin's case back then.

276
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,010
He was very close back then,

277
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:19,640
and might have even found the truth.

278
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,480
In the 2000s,

279
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,840
there weren't many testing agencies.

280
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,600
Fortunately,

281
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,720
this agency kept this report.

282
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:26,840
But unfortunately,

283
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:29,480
you were bribed by Wan Jiliang during Xue Lin's case.

284
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,120
Deliberately concealed this report.

285
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,360
So this test report

286
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,520
was not used back then

287
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,840
as key evidence in Xue Lin's case

288
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,370
and submitted to the court.

289
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,170
Leading to the loss of the case.

290
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,640
Then how did you think of looking into this?

291
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,560
Because I found this.

292
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,120
This is Wangang's report

293
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:48,180
on the tap water renovation project in Fuyuan Village.

294
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,120
The handwriting of the annotations on it

295
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,840
It's exactly the same as Director Wang's.

296
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,170
Actually, for this tea,

297
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,740
the flavor it produces

298
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:58,000
depends on the person who brews it.

299
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,360
This also means

300
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,360
Director Wang helped Wan Jiliang in Xue Lin's case,

301
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,360
and also helped him

302
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,480
resolve the hidden danger of mercury waste,

303
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:09,540
by having him fund tap water access for Fuyuan Village.

304
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,240
I think you can guess the reason.

305
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,360
According to Wangang's corporate ledger,

306
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:15,600
in 1997,

307
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:19,360
Wangang produced a total of 62 tons of mercury catalyst waste.

308
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,840
And the company's expenses for harmless treatment

309
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,520
reached 1.2 million.

310
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,650
All the receipts

311
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,700
have been kept.

312
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:27,840
This proves that

313
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:28,720
all the waste

314
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,720
was properly disposed of.

315
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,720
If, as Attorney Xiao said,

316
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:36,240
mercury waste is buried under Fuyuan Village,

317
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:39,120
then may I ask where it is buried?

318
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:42,000
Wangang took the opportunity of developing Fuyuan Village

319
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,480
to transfer the waste.

320
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,740
Where is the evidence?

321
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:51,000
I understand the situation.

322
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,050
What do you want me to do?

323
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:55,720
Mr. Sun, you are the supervisor of the group.

324
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:58,360
You said you would supervise the group's legal and compliant operations.

325
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,480
So I hope you

326
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:02,720
can persuade the board members as soon as possible

327
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:05,359
to proactively go to the police on behalf of the group

328
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:06,690
and report Wan Jiliang.

329
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:15,359
Lawyer Li.

330
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,650
I can't call you Lawyer Li anymore.

331
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:22,240
You've been suspended.

332
00:17:35,120 --> 00:17:37,840
Your Honor, I request a recess.

333
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:38,840
Objection.

334
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:41,480
This is a deliberate procedural delay.

335
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,200
Your Honor, members of the collegial panel,

336
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:45,480
I will provide crucial evidence shortly.

337
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,440
For both this case

338
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,120
and the case from 28 years ago,

339
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:49,440
it is extremely important.

340
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:52,000
I hope Your Honor can give me some time.

341
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:56,880
Appellant.

342
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,760
The court grants your request for a recess.

343
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:01,480
But if after the recess,

344
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,760
you have no new evidence to submit,

345
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,240
we will proceed with the normal trial procedure

346
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,600
and continue the hearing.

347
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,860
The court is now in recess for 15 minutes.

348
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,330
How's the search going?

349
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:13,980
We didn't dig up anything.

350
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,440
A bunch of us were digging there.

351
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,360
But we found nothing.

352
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,760
Yes, Director. There are 20 spots in total.

353
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:21,240
We dug 16 of them with Uncle Jingang.

354
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,240
It was all dirt.

355
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,900
We didn't see any waste at all.

356
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,480
This is not your style.

357
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,600
It's too mild.

358
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,600
I thought

359
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:34,440
you would definitely prepare some trump cards.

360
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,740
Mr. Wan, you are right.

361
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,640
To convince the board,

362
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:43,240
we indeed need to be fully prepared.

363
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:53,160
Regarding the second trial of the farmers' case,

364
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,240
are you confident?

365
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,240
Xiao Longnv was also trained by me.

366
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,080
Sorry, I need to take a call.

367
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:02,280
I know exactly what she's capable of.

368
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,800
As long as they can't find the waste,

369
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:07,730
she won't be able to make any waves.

370
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:09,480
Don't worry.

371
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,800
It's already being handled.

372
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:13,440
They won't find it.

373
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,200
Attorney Guo Jin.

374
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:18,700
Bluetooth.

375
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,480
Before I became a senior partner,

376
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,480
he had been working on cases with me.

377
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,000
So whether he's telling the truth or lying,

378
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,200
I can tell at a glance.

379
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:28,560
I've finished organizing it.

380
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:29,890
You just need to sign it.

381
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:43,440
Lawyer Li.

382
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:46,520
The document...

383
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,520
seems to have a problem.

384
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:51,160
I'll check it again.

385
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,200
Bluetooth.

386
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:56,400
If I don't sign this contract,

387
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,740
how will you explain it to Director Wang?

388
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,160
I also made him choose.

389
00:20:04,280 --> 00:20:05,040
Just like when you made

390
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:07,320
Lawyer Wang Binghui choose.

391
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:08,800
But fortunately,

392
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,680
he didn't let me down.

393
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:24,570
You think you can bring me down with just this recording?

394
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:27,200
When I founded Wangang,

395
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:30,160
the whole factory was only about 2,000 square meters,

396
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,090
and we had no more than ten workers.

397
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:33,720
Look at it now.

398
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:37,640
Just one workshop in the new factory is over 10,000 square meters.

399
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:40,040
Without me, there would be no Wangang,

400
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:42,200
let alone the current Xingang.

401
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:45,640
You just don't have the vision your master had.

402
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,080
Mr. Wan.

403
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,320
Are you so sure

404
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:55,530
that Director Wang can definitely win this case?

405
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:58,080
Or are you 100% certain

406
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:01,940
that the waste materials will never be discovered?

407
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:04,200
I advise you not to be so optimistic.

408
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:06,290
The seed planted years ago,

409
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:10,040
as long as it breaks through the soil,

410
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,570
it will definitely sprout.

411
00:21:12,760 --> 00:21:14,720
So from the day Fuyuan Village was developed,

412
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:17,120
I knew the waste would definitely be found.

413
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,490
You don't know your son.

414
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:22,520
But I know Lawyer Xiao very well.

415
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:25,240
She will definitely win this battle.

416
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:28,720
Then you need to dig the front part all over again.

417
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:30,000
1997.

418
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:33,160
Wangang produced a total of 62 tons of mercury catalyst waste.

419
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:33,960
Aren't there four left?

420
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:35,240
Hurry up and dig those four.

421
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,080
For the previous 16,

422
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,240
dig a little deeper.

423
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,520
Alright, stop digging.

424
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:39,320
What's wrong?

425
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:40,450
We've been tricked.

426
00:21:41,160 --> 00:21:42,800
I remember Wan Zhuoli

427
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:45,400
drove five dump trucks into Fuyuan Village.

428
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:48,000
Each truck has a capacity of 15 tons,

429
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,680
which adds up to 75 tons.

430
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:51,520
You've dug 16 spots now,

431
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:54,400
and the real soil adds up to about 50 tons.

432
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,400
With the remaining 25 tons of capacity,

433
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,720
how could it possibly hold

434
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,160
62 tons of real waste?

435
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:01,160
Then where did the waste go?

436
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,520
If I'm not mistaken,

437
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,720
the real waste is still in Fuyuan Village.

438
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:05,800
What?

439
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:08,160
Wan Zhuoli tricked us all.

440
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:11,080
He probably dug up the real waste,

441
00:22:11,320 --> 00:22:12,780
but he didn't take it away.

442
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:15,240
He covered the waste with soil,

443
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:17,640
making us think it was dug away.

444
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:18,800
Then, sister,

445
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:21,080
what should we do now?

446
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:23,040
You guys hurry to Fuyuan Village now.

447
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:24,640
We don't have much time left.

448
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,160
Director, we'll go right now.

449
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,420
Yes, hurry up. Come on.

450
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:28,280
Appellant.

451
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:31,480
Do you have any new evidence to submit to the court?

452
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:39,640
Your Honor.

453
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:47,200
Before I present the new evidence,

454
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:51,200
I would like to say a few words to the opposing counsel.

455
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:52,240
May I?

456
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,240
You may.

457
00:22:54,520 --> 00:22:56,520
On my first day in this profession,

458
00:22:58,240 --> 00:22:59,760
you taught us that

459
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,640
as a lawyer,

460
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:05,480
one must harbor a love for justice

461
00:23:06,560 --> 00:23:09,880
and be dedicated to the pursuit of truth and fairness.

462
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:14,000
I believe you were sincere back then.

463
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:15,770
When you were young,

464
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:18,420
you were also passionate and impulsive.

465
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:20,720
You also believe

466
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:25,440
that the law can forge a path for the weak.

467
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:28,520
I told you not to take this case.

468
00:23:28,520 --> 00:23:29,680
You can't win.

469
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,600
Our law firm is just starting out.

470
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:33,040
Don't ask for trouble.

471
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:34,840
Director.

472
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,760
We can't be afraid of losing.

473
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:39,280
I've already found the evidence.

474
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:41,800
You don't understand what I'm saying, do you?

475
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:42,480
But...

476
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:46,040
Persistence doesn't put food on the table.

477
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:48,720
Should we compromise with reality?

478
00:23:49,520 --> 00:23:52,400
This is a required lesson for every young lawyer.

479
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:56,800
Temptation is often like a vine.

480
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:59,800
When a crack appears in human nature,

481
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:02,160
it quietly creeps up.

482
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:03,680
You think it just

483
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:05,560
gently tugs at your hem,

484
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,720
but when you look back,

485
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,050
it has already entangled your whole body.

486
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:15,360
Life's choices are often made in a single thought.

487
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:18,560
It's like dominoes.

488
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:20,560
When the first one falls,

489
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:23,960
the rest of your defenses will also collapse.

490
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:31,810
I would like to ask Lawyer Wang.

491
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:36,920
What kind of temptation

492
00:24:38,080 --> 00:24:39,240
would make such an

493
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:42,040
idealistic and ambitious lawyer

494
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:45,420
choose to abandon their original intention

495
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:48,560
and violate their professional beliefs?

496
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:49,480
Lawyer Xiao,

497
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,280
you are my apprentice.

498
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:54,770
I taught you when you entered the profession.

499
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:57,720
The law speaks with evidence.

500
00:24:58,080 --> 00:24:58,920
In law,

501
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:01,090
facts that cannot be proven

502
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:03,290
are considered non-existent.

503
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:06,340
No matter how well a story is told,

504
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,240
it is just a story.

505
00:25:15,320 --> 00:25:16,080
Your Honor,

506
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:19,240
the appellant's statement has consistently been irrelevant to this case.

507
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:21,480
I request to terminate her statement.

508
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:22,800
Request granted.

509
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:36,760
Appellant,

510
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:39,480
if there is no new evidence to submit to the court,

511
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:42,480
we will proceed to the court debate stage.

512
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:49,180
Your Honor, members of the collegial panel,

513
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:53,040
we are sitting here today

514
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:55,760
not only for my client, Lao Pan,

515
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:56,800
to demand an explanation,

516
00:25:56,800 --> 00:26:00,320
but also to seek justice for the deceived

517
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:03,040
and injured villagers of Fuyuan Village.

518
00:26:04,320 --> 00:26:06,080
The villagers of Fuyuan Village

519
00:26:06,080 --> 00:26:07,560
have the right to know

520
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:10,240
why they got sick

521
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:13,560
and why their relatives died.

522
00:26:13,880 --> 00:26:15,000
The farmers

523
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,700
also have the right to know

524
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:20,080
why their fish and shrimp died.

525
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,760
Hurry up.

526
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:33,940
Who are you?

527
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,280
You can't come in here.

528
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:36,340
Go away. Leave now.

529
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,440
Leave now. Come on.

530
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:37,920
Leave now. Somebody!

531
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:38,760
Hurry.

532
00:26:38,880 --> 00:26:39,520
Hurry.

533
00:26:39,520 --> 00:26:40,240
Hurry. Take it away.

534
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:40,880
Go.

535
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,000
Hurry up. You two, push hard.

536
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:44,440
We ordinary people have the right

537
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:47,760
to know if the land we live on day and night,

538
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:50,440
every drop of water we drink,

539
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:53,000
every bite of food we eat,

540
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,280
and every breath of air we take

541
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:57,000
are safe

542
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,640
and free of problems.

543
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:01,400
This is a right granted to us by law.

544
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:05,260
What are you doing?

545
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:06,800
Quick, catch her!

546
00:27:07,800 --> 00:27:10,480
Anyone, any enterprise...

547
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:13,480
You can't trample on the law for profit,

548
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:16,680
strip away rights, and cover up the truth.

549
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:19,180
Whether it's Wangang or Xingang,

550
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,760
what parents

551
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:23,770
don't want their children to grow up healthy?

552
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:28,280
So you wouldn't want to see the giant ship, Xingang,

553
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:31,140
hit an iceberg right after leaving port.

554
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:36,960
Don't. Don't arrest her.

555
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,120
Hurry! After them!

556
00:27:38,120 --> 00:27:38,450
Stop.

557
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:40,120
I've already called the police.

558
00:27:40,120 --> 00:27:42,250
I'm telling you, I'm an intern lawyer.

559
00:27:42,520 --> 00:27:44,250
We've collected the evidence.

560
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,200
Got all the evidence!

561
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:45,920
Don't run! Stop!

562
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:46,960
Because the law

563
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,720
is the last line of defense for us ordinary people

564
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:51,000
to protect ourselves.

565
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,000
Run, Miaomiao!

566
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:54,160
There's no signal here.

567
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,560
I'll hold them off for you.

568
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:56,890
Run quickly, Miaomiao!

569
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:58,560
Your Honor.

570
00:27:58,880 --> 00:27:59,320
Run.

571
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:02,080
The opposing counsel keeps stalling for time.

572
00:28:02,080 --> 00:28:03,800
I believe she is exploiting the procedure

573
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:06,860
to interfere with judicial justice. Give me the phone.

574
00:28:08,080 --> 00:28:08,720
Found it.

575
00:28:09,040 --> 00:28:10,160
We found the evidence.

576
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:12,220
The waste is still in Fuyuan Village.

577
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,200
Mr. Wan.

578
00:28:27,760 --> 00:28:29,280
The waste has been found.

579
00:28:30,760 --> 00:28:32,520
Before the police find you,

580
00:28:33,080 --> 00:28:35,080
you still have time to make a choice.

581
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:37,520
Will you continue to take your chances

582
00:28:38,560 --> 00:28:41,360
and let decades of your hard work go down the drain,

583
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,520
or will you choose to turn yourself in,

584
00:28:43,520 --> 00:28:45,520
cut ties with the group,

585
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:49,400
and keep this big ship from sinking?

586
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,800
Don't think you've won.

587
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:58,480
I'm not here today to win or lose.

588
00:28:58,760 --> 00:29:00,020
Of course, in my heart,

589
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,820
Wangang will always be my client.

590
00:29:03,080 --> 00:29:04,080
As a lawyer,

591
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:07,200
within the framework of the law,

592
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
finding the optimal solution for my client

593
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:12,960
is my true purpose.

594
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:19,560
Based on the latest evidence provided by the plaintiff,

595
00:29:19,560 --> 00:29:22,240
this case may involve criminal offenses.

596
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:24,560
After deliberation by the collegial panel,

597
00:29:24,560 --> 00:29:27,160
the civil trial of this case is terminated.

598
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:31,160
Transferred to the public security authorities for investigation.

599
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:32,290
Court is adjourned.

600
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:40,240
Good, good, good.

601
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,200
That's great.

602
00:29:41,320 --> 00:29:43,000
Good.

603
00:29:43,280 --> 00:29:48,480
Great, great.

604
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,920
I didn't lose to you and Xiao Longnv.

605
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:18,920
I just

606
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:22,680
lost to fate.

607
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:25,720
If it weren't for

608
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:29,320
the Baizhao River changing course and polluting the farm,

609
00:30:29,320 --> 00:30:31,520
I would have kept walking down this path

610
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:33,810
until the end of my life.

611
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,480
I never understood

612
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:38,240
why you did this.

613
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,880
If I had chosen to help Xue Lin back then,

614
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:43,640
I might still be a failure today,

615
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:47,180
unable to even support my wife and child.

616
00:30:48,520 --> 00:30:49,640
At that time,

617
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:53,920
who would have paid for my narrow sense of justice?

618
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:58,720
Look, I built Honghu single-handedly.

619
00:30:59,520 --> 00:31:02,320
I gave many people a comfortable life.

620
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:06,040
This is something that poor boy could never achieve in several lifetimes.

621
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:07,370
You can't get it either.

622
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:09,640
But the path you chose

623
00:31:11,320 --> 00:31:13,240
came at the expense of others.

624
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,880
But I helped more people.

625
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,240
True.

626
00:31:18,240 --> 00:31:20,680
Individual sacrifice is regrettable,

627
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:24,760
but justice for the majority is more important.

628
00:31:25,760 --> 00:31:28,960
If you were me back then,

629
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:31,250
what would you have chosen?

630
00:31:33,040 --> 00:31:34,080
Saying 'I had no choice'

631
00:31:34,080 --> 00:31:35,400
sounds tragic,

632
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:37,240
but it's just a self-glorifying

633
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,480
moral sanctuary.

634
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:41,680
If you hadn't taken a shortcut back then,

635
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:44,090
and instead persuaded Wan Jiliang

636
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,320
to dig out the waste early

637
00:31:46,760 --> 00:31:49,090
to prevent the pollution from worsening,

638
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:52,610
things definitely wouldn't have ended like this today.

639
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:55,800
Some paths,

640
00:31:58,480 --> 00:31:59,540
once you go too far,

641
00:32:01,040 --> 00:32:02,480
there's no turning back.

642
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:07,560
Master.

643
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:12,050
Even though you made a mistake,

644
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:14,040
you will always be my master.

645
00:32:16,560 --> 00:32:18,240
To speak for the voiceless.

646
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,720
To wield a sword for the shieldless.

647
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,900
Although I don't often say it,

648
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,880
this is what you taught me.

649
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,680
Are you Wang Binghui?

650
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:46,240
This is a detention notice.

651
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:47,370
Please come with us.

652
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,040
Li Xin.

653
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:04,640
I'll leave Honghu to you.

654
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:05,770
Let's go.

655
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,000
Let's go.

656
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:19,320
Dad.

657
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:32,880
Let's go.

658
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:49,880
Get in.

659
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,560
Uncle.

660
00:34:18,040 --> 00:34:18,699
Brother Hu.

661
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:23,370
Sister Long asked us to pick you up.

662
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,940
You have to drive this car.

663
00:34:27,639 --> 00:34:29,170
I can't seem to shift gears.

664
00:34:33,960 --> 00:34:36,760
Manual transmission is definitely hard to drive.

665
00:34:37,639 --> 00:34:39,969
Get in. Let's go back to our great law firm.

666
00:34:43,080 --> 00:34:43,639
Let's go.

667
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,330
Why did you stall it too?

668
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,520
I always drive luxury cars.

669
00:34:48,520 --> 00:34:49,840
It spoiled me.

670
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:51,920
Slow down.

671
00:34:53,880 --> 00:34:54,940
Phone: 1335249304

672
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:21,560
Doctor.

673
00:35:22,120 --> 00:35:22,920
How is my dad?

674
00:35:24,720 --> 00:35:25,920
Please rest assured.

675
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:28,020
The surgery was very successful.

676
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:29,480
Successful? That's great.

677
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:30,800
Thank God.

678
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:32,080
Thank you, Doctor.

679
00:35:32,080 --> 00:35:33,680
Thank you for your hard work.

680
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:38,480
Now a weight has been lifted off my mind.

681
00:35:40,160 --> 00:35:41,680
I forgot to congratulate you.

682
00:35:41,680 --> 00:35:43,080
Your suspension is over.

683
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:44,780
Good things come in pairs.

684
00:35:45,520 --> 00:35:47,250
I should congratulate you too.

685
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,440
You won the case.

686
00:35:49,560 --> 00:35:52,090
How did the compensation talks go? Smoothly?

687
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:54,200
Speaking of this, I have to talk about

688
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,760
those guys on your team.

689
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:57,040
Why are they so annoying?

690
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:58,840
Always bargaining with me.

691
00:35:58,840 --> 00:36:01,320
It shows they are serious and responsible about their work.

692
00:36:01,320 --> 00:36:04,450
Discussing compensation is within a reasonable scope.

693
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:06,480
Just wait.

694
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:08,480
Wait for me to wipe them all out.

695
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,480
Wait until I get back.

696
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:09,800
I'm telling you,

697
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:11,320
I won't show you any mercy.

698
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:12,720
You know,

699
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:15,160
I've realized something.

700
00:36:15,160 --> 00:36:15,840
Are we

701
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:21,480
just incompatible?

702
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:24,920
When we were in school, we said we'd take the college entrance exam together.

703
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:25,640
In the end,

704
00:36:26,040 --> 00:36:27,680
we couldn't go to the same college.

705
00:36:27,680 --> 00:36:29,320
After graduation, we said we'd be colleagues.

706
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:31,160
But we were only colleagues for a few years

707
00:36:31,160 --> 00:36:32,220
before we split up.

708
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:34,480
After that, we became rivals.

709
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:36,760
We always cross paths like enemies.

710
00:36:37,280 --> 00:36:38,280
This is fate.

711
00:36:39,080 --> 00:36:40,320
What fate?

712
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,480
Since when did you become so superstitious?

713
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,320
What do you mean we split up?

714
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:44,960
We've known each other since we were kids.

715
00:36:44,960 --> 00:36:46,490
Tell me, how can we split up?

716
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,200
Why are you getting so worked up?

717
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:00,810
It's pretty good

718
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,320
for us to be like this.

719
00:37:03,520 --> 00:37:04,400
I will

720
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:07,280
protect my little fish and shrimp,

721
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,920
keeping them alive and kicking.

722
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,480
And you

723
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:12,960
will protect your big ship as it sets sail.

724
00:37:13,080 --> 00:37:13,680
The two of us

725
00:37:13,680 --> 00:37:17,080
will keep this sea area clean.

726
00:37:17,200 --> 00:37:17,960
This can be considered

727
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:20,160
a perfect match in a sense.

728
00:37:22,520 --> 00:37:24,320
That's a great way to put it.

729
00:37:24,680 --> 00:37:25,840
Let's have a drink

730
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:27,080
to celebrate.

731
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:27,840
Cheers.

732
00:37:28,040 --> 00:37:28,520
Cheers.

733
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:32,600
Make an exception and have a couple of drinks.

734
00:37:32,600 --> 00:37:34,800
I absolutely cannot make an exception.

735
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:36,720
Okay, you have your principles.

736
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:43,120
Okay.

737
00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:44,000
Thank you, Brother Jun.

738
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,600
You're here, Brother Jun.

739
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,040
Dad.

740
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:49,520
Okay.

741
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:52,920
Well,

742
00:37:53,160 --> 00:37:56,680
let's go back to the law firm and take a shower on the first floor.

743
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:58,040
The fire pan and everything

744
00:37:58,040 --> 00:37:59,240
are all ready for you.

745
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,520
Okay.

746
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:01,600
You.

747
00:38:02,520 --> 00:38:03,520
Don't look back.

748
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:05,480
I won't look back.

749
00:38:06,040 --> 00:38:07,160
Never coming back.

750
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,320
Thanks for your hard work, Dad.

751
00:38:09,320 --> 00:38:10,040
Thank you.

752
00:38:10,040 --> 00:38:10,560
Thanks.

753
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:19,980
Is Li Guochen feeling better?

754
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:23,880
Who is he?

755
00:38:24,400 --> 00:38:25,130
Brother Jun.

756
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:28,060
Director Li doesn't recognize people anymore.

757
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,120
Didn't they say the surgery was very successful?

758
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,840
The surgery was quite successful,

759
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:35,480
but

760
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:37,360
there's a problem in here.

761
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:38,880
He's retarded.

762
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:41,680
What do you mean retarded? That's called amnesia.

763
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:43,360
Old Li.

764
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:47,080
Such a good person like you getting this disease.

765
00:38:47,080 --> 00:38:48,360
If I had known you'd get this thing,

766
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,440
when I played billiards with you in the past,

767
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:52,570
I definitely would have let you win a few shots, you know?

768
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,400
What? Do I need you to let me win?

769
00:38:55,400 --> 00:38:56,800
With your lousy skills,

770
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:59,900
I could beat you even in a wheelchair, believe it or not?

771
00:39:06,560 --> 00:39:07,890
Are you messing with me?

772
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:10,410
You guys have betrayed me too, huh?

773
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:13,120
My dad took it to heart.

774
00:39:13,120 --> 00:39:14,840
Xin, you're still laughing.

775
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:18,400
But Xiaolong told me,

776
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,280
Xin and Hu,

777
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:21,480
you two made a great contribution to this matter.

778
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:24,320
From now on, Hu is also my godson.

779
00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:26,960
From now on, you two are sworn brothers.

780
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:28,520
We are all brothers.

781
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:29,440
Okay, Dad.

782
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,000
Let's go.

783
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:31,460
Push Uncle Li and let's go.

784
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:32,690
I'm not pushing him.

785
00:39:33,040 --> 00:39:34,080
You old geezer.

786
00:39:34,680 --> 00:39:36,320
Let's go. Let's go take a bath.

787
00:39:36,320 --> 00:39:37,380
What an old geezer.

788
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:38,800
Slow down, brother.

789
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:39,800
Let's go.

790
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:40,400
Don't.

791
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:41,620
Taking off.

792
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:43,920
Good job, brother.

793
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:58,410
Little brother.

794
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:01,000
That's a generation lower.

795
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:02,480
I used to call him Brother Jun.

796
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,520
How old are you?

797
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:10,800
Hello, Director Li.

798
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:13,680
Cut it out.

799
00:40:14,040 --> 00:40:15,300
Just call me Lawyer Li.

800
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:17,480
Are you afraid we'll make you sound old?

801
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,800
If you three give me less trouble,

802
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:20,280
I might age a bit slower.

803
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:21,440
But boss,

804
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:24,520
you have to give us a heads-up for something this big.

805
00:40:24,520 --> 00:40:26,360
We were about to hand in our resignation letters.

806
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:26,840
Let me tell you, Lawyer Li,

807
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:28,320
you really have to bring me along for this kind of thing.

808
00:40:28,320 --> 00:40:29,800
I've loved watching spy movies since I was a kid.

809
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,800
I've always

810
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:31,840
wanted to be an undercover agent.

811
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,360
I have great mental strength.

812
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:34,320
You?

813
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:37,120
You probably wouldn't survive the opening theme.

814
00:40:37,120 --> 00:40:38,480
Now you're lecturing me, huh?

815
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:40,280
You damn traitor!

816
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,040
Ruoqi.

817
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:46,920
Coming.

818
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:48,360
Lawyer Li,

819
00:40:49,240 --> 00:40:50,770
I'm here to report for duty.

820
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:53,000
Ruoqi,

821
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:56,040
are you planning to leave again this time?

822
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:57,280
Where would I go?

823
00:40:57,760 --> 00:40:59,960
I'm staying to fight alongside you all.

824
00:41:00,520 --> 00:41:02,650
Please call me Lawyer Wang from now on.

825
00:41:03,520 --> 00:41:05,180
Isn't this a double blessing?

826
00:41:07,520 --> 00:41:08,850
Today is such a good day.

827
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:09,880
It really is.

828
00:41:10,080 --> 00:41:12,640
How about we name our team 'Today is a Good Day'?

829
00:41:12,640 --> 00:41:14,080
Sure, why not?

830
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:15,360
Alright, let's get to work.

831
00:41:15,360 --> 00:41:16,800
Let's go, back to work.

832
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:17,920
This name sounds

833
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:19,880
like a big professional team.

834
00:41:20,120 --> 00:41:20,960
Let's have BBQ tonight.

835
00:41:20,960 --> 00:41:22,160
Sure, your treat.

836
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:23,960
Hello.

837
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:24,920
Li Xin,

838
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:28,440
I heard you became the director.

839
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:30,460
Congratulations!

840
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:37,560
Come on,

841
00:41:38,080 --> 00:41:38,960
Sister Pang.

842
00:41:39,560 --> 00:41:40,760
Lawyer Xiao is back.

843
00:41:41,200 --> 00:41:42,680
Two female guests inside.

844
00:41:43,160 --> 00:41:44,120
That Wangang case,

845
00:41:44,120 --> 00:41:46,000
our law firm won it, bro.

846
00:41:46,560 --> 00:41:49,120
I wouldn't say our firm is renowned in Leyang,

847
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:50,960
but we are definitely well-known.

848
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,880
